# The SSH library's build outputs, which are not in git: they differ from machine to machine, so they would give
# each machine its own fingerprint, and the Rust build folder alone is over a gigabyte to hash. Its sources still
# count, so a Rust change asks for a new build.
**/react-native-ssh/rust/target/**/*
**/react-native-ssh/ios/*.xcframework/**/*
**/react-native-ssh/lib/**/*
